  "ruleText": "He-P 817.18 Quality Assessment. The collection station or mobile collection station van shall develop and implement a quality assessment program that reviews policies and services and maximizes quality by preventing or correcting identified problems.\n\nSource. #5775, eff 1-24-94, EXPIRED: 1-24-00\n\nNew. #8410 eff 8-19-05; ss by #8853, eff 3-24-07, EXPIRED: 3-24-15\n\nNew. #10830, INTERIM, eff 5-25-15, EXPIRES: 11-21-15; ss by #10979, eff 11-20-15",
